{
  "name": "candela-ia-backend",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20 <25"
  },
  "description": "Backend de Candela IA — NestJS + Prisma + MySQL, arquitectura DDD",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "prisma generate && nest build",
    "start": "nest start",
    "dev": "nest start --watch",
    "start:prod": "node dist/main",
    "start:deploy": "prisma migrate deploy && node dist/main",
    "lint": "eslint \"{src,test}/**/*.ts\" --fix",
    "test": "jest",
    "test:watch": "jest --watch",
    "db:setup": "ts-node scripts/setup-db.ts",
    "probar:prompts": "ts-node scripts/probar-prompts.ts",
    "db:init": "npm run db:setup && prisma migrate dev --name inicial && prisma generate",
    "prisma:generate": "prisma generate",
    "prisma:migrate": "prisma migrate dev",
    "prisma:studio": "prisma studio",
    "premium": "ts-node scripts/conceder-premium.ts"
  },
  "//prisma": "El CLI de prisma va en dependencies, no en devDependencies, porque Railway lo necesita DESPUES de construir: el paso previo al despliegue corre `prisma migrate deploy`, y para entonces el constructor ya puede haber podado las dependencias de desarrollo. Como devDependency, el despliegue falla con `prisma: not found` justo antes de arrancar.",
  "//overrides": "js-yaml 5.0.0-5.2.1 tiene un fallo de denegación de servicio (GHSA-pm4m-ph32-ghv5). @nestjs/swagger la trae anidada, así que npm audit fix no la alcanza. Se fuerza a 5.2.3, que ya está parcheada. El override está acotado a @nestjs/swagger para no tocar la copia 4.x que usa el CLI.",
  "overrides": {
    "@nestjs/swagger": {
      "js-yaml": "^5.2.3"
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@nestjs/common": "^11.0.0",
    "@nestjs/config": "^4.0.0",
    "@nestjs/core": "^11.0.0",
    "@nestjs/jwt": "^11.0.0",
    "@nestjs/passport": "^11.0.0",
    "@nestjs/platform-express": "^11.0.0",
    "@nestjs/swagger": "^11.0.0",
    "@nestjs/throttler": "^6.4.0",
    "@prisma/client": "^6.3.0",
    "class-transformer": "^0.5.1",
    "class-validator": "^0.14.1",
    "openai": "^7.4.0",
    "passport": "^0.7.0",
    "passport-jwt": "^4.0.1",
    "prisma": "^6.3.0",
    "reflect-metadata": "^0.2.2",
    "rxjs": "^7.8.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@nestjs/cli": "^11.0.0",
    "@nestjs/schematics": "^11.0.0",
    "@nestjs/testing": "^11.0.0",
    "@types/express": "^5.0.0",
    "@types/jest": "^29.5.14",
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "@types/passport-jwt": "^4.0.1",
    "dotenv": "^16.4.7",
    "jest": "^29.7.0",
    "mysql2": "^3.12.0",
    "ts-jest": "^29.2.5",
    "ts-node": "^10.9.2",
    "typescript": "^5.7.0"
  },
  "jest": {
    "moduleFileExtensions": [
      "js",
      "json",
      "ts"
    ],
    "rootDir": "src",
    "testRegex": ".*\\.spec\\.ts$",
    "transform": {
      "^.+\\.(t|j)s$": "ts-jest"
    },
    "testEnvironment": "node"
  }
}
